{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_adr_0020", "label": "ADR-0020: Mobile navigation \u2014 React Navigation native-stack on bare RN", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "App.tsx hand-rolled routing with a session union, a showGallery boolean and prop callbacks works for two screens but not thirteen modules shipping in lockstep with web (Law 7), and it has no answer for deep links (customer-link) or notification taps. A new dependency plus a new architectural pattern requires an ADR under Law 2."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_react_navigation_v7", "label": "React Navigation v7 native-stack", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pins @react-navigation/native 7.3.14 and native-stack 7.18.6, verified against react-native 0.86.0 / React 19.2.3. Native-stack wraps the platform navigator, giving real transitions, gesture behaviour and better memory behaviour on low-end Android \u2014 relevant to the field-first audience."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_react_native_screens", "label": "react-native-screens 4.26.2 (native peer)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A native module, so pod install for iOS and Gradle sync for Android; bare RN means we own this (no CNG to automate it), but it is the same library RN's recommended stack depends on, so it tracks the mainstream upgrade path."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_rootnavigator", "label": "RootNavigator (session gate lives here)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_rootstackparamlist", "label": "RootStackParamList \u2014 typed route names", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A wrong route name or wrong params becomes a compile error, and a screen's props are its route params \u2014 replacing callback chains where a wrong target stayed a runtime bug."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_linking_ts", "label": "src/navigation/linking.ts \u2014 one deep-link owner", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One place, so customer-link URLs and notification taps cannot each invent their own routing path."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_mobile_app_entry_thin", "label": "dependency-cruiser rule mobile-app-entry-thin", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "App.tsx never imports a screen \u2014 landed at warn 2026-07-27 and flips to error in the implementation slice; this is what permanently prevents App.tsx regrowing a hand-rolled router."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_navigation_structure", "label": "apps/mobile navigation folder structure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "App.tsx \u226440 lines (i18n \u2192 SafeAreaProvider \u2192 NavigationContainer \u2192 RootNavigator) with src/navigation/{RootNavigator,routes,linking}; the inline Home moves to src/screens/home/HomeScreen.tsx and its raw Pressable/Text styling is replaced with src/ui in the same move."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_one_time_signature_cost", "label": "One-time screen-signature migration cost", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every existing screen loses its callback props; the cost grows with each screen added before the move, which is the argument for doing it now rather than at module three."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_hand_rolled_router", "label": "Rejected: keep the hand-rolled router", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Zero dependency cost, but every new screen adds a boolean and a callback chain, with no deep-link story and no typed params."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_expo_router", "label": "Rejected: Expo Router", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Conceptually a good fit but Expo-coupled, and ADR-0011's directive excludes Expo outright."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_wix_react_native_navigation", "label": "Rejected: react-native-navigation (Wix)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Genuinely native screens but heavier native integration, smaller ecosystem and a much larger blast radius on RN upgrades."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_js_stack", "label": "Rejected: JS stack (@react-navigation/stack)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "More styling control, worse performance and non-native gesture feel."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0011_mobile_bare_react_native_adr_0011", "label": "ADR-0011: Bare React Native (no Expo)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_typed_route_names", "label": "Navigation by typed route name, never prop callbacks", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A wrong route name or wrong params becomes a compile error instead of a runtime bug; a screen's props are its route params."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_native_rebuild_cost", "label": "Native rebuild and both-simulator verification", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "react-native-screens is a native module: pod install for iOS, Gradle sync for Android, verified on both simulators per the mobile Definition of Done \u2014 bare RN means we own this, with no CNG to automate it."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_adr_0020", "target": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_react_navigation_v7", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_react_navigation_v7", "target": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_react_native_screens", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_react_navigation_v7", "target": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_rootnavigator", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_rootnavigator", "target": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_rootstackparamlist", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_rootnavigator", "target": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_linking_ts", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_navigation_structure", "target": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_rootnavigator", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_mobile_app_entry_thin", "target": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_navigation_structure", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_mobile_app_entry_thin", "target": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_hand_rolled_router", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_typed_route_names", "target": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_rootstackparamlist", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_one_time_signature_cost", "target": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_adr_0020", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_native_rebuild_cost", "target": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_react_native_screens", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0020-mobile-navigation-react-navigation.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0020_mobile_navigation_react_navigation_adr_0020", "target": "docs_adr_0011_mobile_bar